1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,525
This is ExportAgent, an AI export desk for apparel and textile exporters.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,116
A German buyer has just sent a revised purchase order: Rev 1 of PO NW-45120.

3
00:00:14,366 --> 00:00:19,059
Here is their email, with the purchase order attached as a PDF.

4
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:26,253
Nemotron Nano extracted every field, with a confidence score and the exact source quote.

5
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:32,333
Python then checks each one: is the quote really in the email, and do the sizes add up?

6
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:37,730
The order keeps every version, and Python compares them field by field.

7
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:44,923
The total is up 1,500 pieces, and the date moved 15 days earlier.

8
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:50,799
Navy alone is up 33%. Every change goes to the risk check.

9
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:56,360
The plan is infeasible, so this run escalated to Nemotron Ultra.

10
00:00:56,610 --> 00:01:03,437
4,186 pieces short, and the contract value is up 12.5%.

11
00:01:03,687 --> 00:01:05,756
The trace shows every step.

12
00:01:05,990 --> 00:01:10,833
Ultra chose to check Germany's labelling rules with a Tavily web search.

13
00:01:11,083 --> 00:01:15,648
Every source is listed under the finding, as a link you can open.

14
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:21,711
Nemotron Super wrote the reply, and Python checked all 14 values in it.

15
00:01:21,961 --> 00:01:27,230
Both delivery options, all on 8 December or a split shipment, come from Python.

16
00:01:28,850 --> 00:01:33,479
A person approves every reply. Nothing is emailed automatically.

17
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:38,787
Capacity, lead times and invoice formats live in factory profiles.

18
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:46,341
The same revision is infeasible in Tiruppur, but feasible in Dhaka, at 72% of capacity.

19
00:01:46,591 --> 00:01:51,285
Switching profiles changes the exporter, the port and the paperwork.

20
00:01:51,410 --> 00:01:55,378
The buyer accepts the split shipment, so we record that decision.

21
00:01:56,910 --> 00:02:01,497
ExportAgent generates an invoice and a packing list for each shipment.

22
00:02:01,910 --> 00:02:07,393
Every number is computed in Python. Anything unknown prints as TO BE CONFIRMED.

23
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:14,495
Every model call runs on Nebius Token Factory. Nano reads, Super drafts and judges risk.

24
00:02:14,745 --> 00:02:20,163
Ultra is used only when a trigger fires: about 21% of risk runs.

25
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:27,087
Measured live, a whole email costs under one cent: $0.0094.

26
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:32,316
On a held-out test set, it found every high-risk issue.

27
00:02:35,970 --> 00:02:41,858
ExportAgent: every buyer email read, checked and answered, with a person in control.
